        <b>Type:</b> Ancient Cross <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>4</b> Condition: <b>4</b> (5 is best)   Ambience: <b>4</b>  Access: <b>5</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 57.147971 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: 25.37658<img src="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/a558/a312/gallery/Eastern_Europe/Latvia/thumb/Udri_img_0006.jpg" align="right" valign="top"></a>
<br />
                     Ūdri cross stone is located at Pūķi (as Ūdri are renamed recently) farmstead (Amata parish/pagasts) living house, 12–15 meters from it's DR corner, at the right side of entrance road, besides l...<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
