<Placemark>   <name>Jaunannas Akmen</name>   <description><![CDATA[
        <b>Type:</b> Marker Stone <b>Alt Name:</b> Stone of Jaunanna <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>5</b> Condition: <b>4</b> (5 is best)   Ambience: <b>3</b>  Access: <b>5</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 57.25045 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: 27.06125<img src="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/a558/a312/gallery/Eastern_Europe/Latvia/thumb/DSCF6626.r1024.JPG" align="right" valign="top"></a>
<br />
                    About 25 km South of Alūksne, along road P.43, a marker stone stands at the start of the gravel road leading to Jaunanna.  It doesn't have any particular name ; Pagasts means Parish.. It may be a dec...<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
