                    ]]></description>    <styleUrl>#67_r</styleUrl>   <Point>     <coordinates>27.06125,57.25045,0</coordinates>   </Point>  </Placemark>
<Placemark>   <name>Kapsēdes dižakmens</name>   <description><![CDATA[
        <b>Type:</b> Marker Stone <b>Alt Name:</b> Big Stone of Kapsede <br /> Pos Accuracy: <b>5</b> Condition: <b>3</b> (5 is best)   Ambience: <b>4</b>  Access: <b>5</b>  (5 is best)<br />
                    <b>Lat:</b> 56.58675 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>Long</b>: 21.10865<img src="http://www.megalithic.co.uk/a558/a312/gallery/Eastern_Europe/Latvia/thumb/DSCF8053.r1024.JPG" align="right" valign="top"></a>
<br />
                    One of the largest boulders of Latvia.. Sitting at a former major crossroads near Kapsēde (North of Liepāja) – or rather being the reason why several ancient roads converged to this monumental lan...<b>.</b> (c) Meg. Portal contributors.<br />
